{"item":{"description":"Following on from the successful FULCRUM knife, Extrema Ratio developed a bayonet version of that design. Like the original FULCRUM, this bayonet is extremely versatile and strong. The tanto-shaped blade allows for large amounts of work and wear while still keeping a sharp edge at its exceedingly sturdy tip. This feature, combined with a sharp false edge, makes the knife retain sufficient combat penetration capability to engage targets covered in heavy clothing, padding, or soft ballistic protections. Thanks to its weight and top-heavy balancing, the FULCRUM BAYONET blade is suitable for hard work on the field.","height":1,"iconLink":"https://assets.tarkov.dev/54491bb74bdc2d09088b4567-icon.webp","id":"54491bb74bdc2d09088b4567","image8xLink":"https://assets.tarkov.dev/54491bb74bdc2d09088b4567-8x.webp","inAllModes":true,"inspectImageLink":"https://assets.tarkov.dev/54491bb74bdc2d09088b4567-image.webp","name":"ER FULCRUM BAYONET","normalizedName":"er-fulcrum-bayonet","shortName":"ER BAYONET","wikiLink":"https://escapefromtarkov.fandom.com/ru/wiki/ER_Fulcrum_Bayonet","width":2,"containsItems":[],"properties":{"slashDamage":25,"stabDamage":27,"propertiesType":"ItemPropertiesMelee","categories":[{"id":"5b5f7a0886f77409407a7f96","name":"Melee","normalizedName":"melee-weapons","imageLink":"https://assets.tarkov.dev/handbook-category-5b5f7a0886f77409407a7f96-icon.webp"},{"id":"5b5f78dc86f77409407a7f8e","name":"Weapons","normalizedName":"weapons","imageLink":"https://assets.tarkov.dev/handbook-category-5b5f78dc86f77409407a7f8e-icon.webp"}],"weight":0.45},"minLevelForFlea":0,"trades":{"avg24hPrice":null,"bestBuyVendor":null,"bestSellVendor":{"currency":"RUB","price":8208,"priceRUB":8208,"vendor":{"normalizedName":"jaeger","minTraderLevel":null},"displayedValue":"8 208 ₽ "},"buyFleaSellTrader":null,"buyTraderSellFlea":null,"changeLast48h":null,"flea":{"vendor":{"name":"FleaMarket","normalizedName":"flea-market"}},"profit":null},"barters":{"bartersFor":[]